Z||000000||Master_Sushi||07-13-2001||11:28 AM||||I've done allot to my white 88 coupe since I got it a year ago. When I last posted a pic of it it had no sunroof,tech wheels with clearcoat falling off,and a bunch of other little things I cant remember. I'll post a pic of it just to show off all the hard work i've been doing lately ;p. I also bought a 84SE in very sad shape from KevinP (I dont know if hes still on the fiero forum). I orignally decided to take the sunroof off this car then part it out. But it looked very sad so I decided to restore it   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. I've got a ways to go on both my cars but heres what I have so far.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/WhiteSushi.JPG">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BlackSushi.JPG">  <P>The black fiero im going to sell when I'm done with it, It wont be show car quality. But it will make a great daily driver when im finished. I will be selling it for pretty cheap also.<P>My white fiero stole the sunroof out of the black one...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I am probably going to keep my white 88 coupe for a long time. My plans are to add a stock spoiler, Leather everything interior, and a better engine.<P>Well, let me know what you think   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.<P>Thanks<P>EDIT: Ignore messy garage...<p>[This message has been edited by Master_Sushi (edited 07-13-2001).]||||reg||14
